         <p xml:id="PressMint-CZ_1848-04-05-f2413420-c8eb-11e9-bfd1-5ef3fc9bb22f.p100">Tisk Jaroslawa Pospíšila.</p>
         <lb xml:id="PressMint-CZ_1848-04-05-f2413420-c8eb-11e9-bfd1-5ef3fc9bb22f.pb4.cb3.lb80" facs="#PressMint-CZ_1848-04-05-f2413420-c8eb-11e9-bfd1-5ef3fc9bb22f.f.pg3.a1.c3.l80"/>
         <p xml:id="PressMint-CZ_1848-04-05-f2413420-c8eb-11e9-bfd1-5ef3fc9bb22f.p101">Papír z dilny Fr. Loreicowých synů a Eichmanna w Ho-</p>
